{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/899583-interest-check-dark-ages-vtm-kingdom-of-sicily","id":899583,"title":"Interest Check Dark Ages VtM: Kingdom of Sicily","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-05-25T17:46:20-07:00","id":899583,"title":"Interest Check Dark Ages VtM: Kingdom of Sicily","content":"Hello all, I am new to these forums and have chosen to go by the moniker Melora after my favorite singer in the world, Melora Creager.<br /> <br /> I and a co-ST are working on a PBP (on mythweavers) game for DA20 set in the Kingdom of Sicily, as best we have been able to recreate it. There will hopefully be big challenges between the High and Low clans/bloodlines during this weird kingdom ruled by Frederick the 2nd. The game should be ready by this time next week or the week after that as my Co-ST is having some family changes and I am spoiling my mother for late mother's day and working out some stuff myself.<br /> <br /> The only disallowed vampire types are: Anda, Bonsam, Children of Osiris, Lhiannan, and all Salubri castes. Baali are allowed but still side eyed pretty heartily because reasons, as are Caitiffs.<br /> <br /> I am curious if there is any interest in this? The game forum, for what it currently has, is on my signature. I have homebrewed a few Road offshoots and high level Discipline powers (I am quite well known for homebrew on Mythweavers) and would like to see if anyone has any interest on the main forums. I, personally, don't do Skype or G+ Hangouts games due to high levels of social anxiety so PBP has become a big balm for me.<br /> <br /> I'm also new, have read the rules, and hope this doesn't break them. Thanks to all!<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Debating between ghouls and hunters PbP","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user